00:44:51.990 --> 00:44:54.090
At the highest level
what happens is

00:44:54.090 --> 00:44:56.820
it takes your problem
and it transforms it.

00:44:56.820 --> 00:44:59.037
Just you get an
equivalent problem,

00:44:59.037 --> 00:45:00.870
and then you get another
equivalent problem,

00:45:00.870 --> 00:45:01.740
and another one.

00:45:01.740 --> 00:45:05.430
And you reduce it through
a chain of equivalences

00:45:05.430 --> 00:45:08.310
until you get to some
standard form we can solve,

00:45:08.310 --> 00:45:12.030
like a linear program, quadratic
program, or second order cone

00:45:12.030 --> 00:45:13.650
programming, or
semidefinite program.

00:45:13.650 --> 00:45:14.730
So that's the first part.

00:45:14.730 --> 00:45:16.560
We're actually not going to
